   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Describe the major elements of a positioning statement. Which words in the following Walt Disney World positioning statement—“For the young and young-at-heart, Walt Disney World is the theme park that best delivers on an immersive and magical experience because Walt Disney World, and only Walt Disney World, connects you to the characters and worlds you most desire”—illustrate what Disney World promises customers and why it delivers on this promise better than competitors in the entertainment industry?",
